==Event Information==
The Battle Cats cross paths with the heroes of {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Merc Storia'''}} for a special crossover event!<br>
{{Color|#008000|'''March 9th (11aam) through March 23rd (11am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Merc Storia Limited Collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
For a limited time, you can collect special collab units from Merc Storia in the Rare Capsule Machine!<br>
20 characters available only in this capsule set, only during this limited edition collab event!

・Collect the following:<br>
[[Eyewaltz (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#335599|'''Eyewaltz (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
100% Survives one Lethal Attack! Area attacks have a chance of Savage Blow.<br>
[[Todomeki (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Todomeki (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks might Slow Aliens & Zombies!<br>
[[Michelia (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Michelia (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs Floatin with a chance for Area Attacks to Freeze!<br>
[[Hearscht (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Hearscht (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Might Critical Attack, Tough vs Metal!<br>
[[Cornelia (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cornelia (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks might Freeze Red & Black!<br>
[[Juvens (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Juvens (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs Angel enemies!<br>
[[Mystica (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Mystica (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Long-range Area attacks, plus Strong vs Black.<br>
[[Wyvern (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Wyvern (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive Area damage vs Black enemies!

PLUS<br>
{{Color|#FF6600|'''Super Rare Units:'''}} [[Orthos (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Orthos'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6600|''','''}} [[Citrouille (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Citrouille'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6600|''','''}} [[Rei (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Rei'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6600|''','''}} [[Aura (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Aura'''}}]]<br>
{{Color|#FF6600|'''Rare Units:'''}} [[Celesse (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Celesse'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6600|''','''}} [[Nono (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Nono'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6600|''','''}} [[Olga (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Olga'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6600|''','''}} [[Norn (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Norn'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6600|''','''}} [[Yoichi (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Yoichi'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6600|''','''}} [[Serum (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Serum'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6600|''','''}} [[Fuu (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Fuu'''}}]]

<small><small>※Please note that draws from the Merc Storia rare capsules set may provide regularly appearing rare Cat units. Merc Storia collab units will not be available from other scheduled Rare Capsule sets appearing during the collaboration.<br>
※If Merc Storia content does not appear in your version of The Battle Cats, please update to the most recent version of the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Collab Stages in Legend Stories!'''}}<br>
The Healer and his allies are waiting for you to challenge them! Face down Merc Storia characters as tough foes in these special maps!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''・Collab Map: "Merc Storia: Showdown!"'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6600|'''・Collab Map: "Merch Storia: Inferno"'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend Stages and select these maps from the Collab Stages section. Clearing any stage will give you a small chance to unlock the limited collab character [[Healer (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''Healer'''}}]], but more difficult stages have a higher drop rate! (Or, use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to unlock the character upon stage clear.)<br>
<small><small>※ After unlocking Healer, activate the character by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu!</small></small>

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Collab Map: "Merch Storia: Attack"'''}}<br>
Get tons of XP when you clear this stage!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''・Collab Map: "Merc Storia: Mystery"'''}}<br>
Get a chance to unlock a limited edition collabunit when you clear this stage!<br>
Ear bigger and bett rewards based on your Timed Score after clearing the stage.<br>
<small><small>※ Tap the Timed Score button on the mpa menu to see a list of available prizes.</small></small>

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Collab Map: "Merch Storia: Healer Awakens"'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Collab Map: "Merch Storia: Merc Awakens"'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Collab Map: "Merch Storia: Titi Awakens"'''}}<br>
Clear the stages for a chance to {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''unlock the True Form evolution'''}} of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Healer'''}}, {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Merc'''}} and {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Titi'''}}!

<small><small>※Characters may be upgraded to their True Form after reaching Level 20.<br>
※If "Merc Storia: Mystery" is cleared before the character is collected, it is possible you may unlock the True Form before teh actual Cat Units.<br>
※If Merc Storia content does not appear in your version of The Battle Cats, please update to the most recent version of the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Ranking Stage "Weak of Spirit" at the Catclaw Dojo!'''}}<br>
Visit the Catclaw Dojo's special collab event {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Weak of Spirit'''}} and {{Color|#FF6600|'''pit your score against a world of the Battle Cats fans'''}} as you race to the top of the leaderboards!<br>
Clear the stage, get a high score andd earn rewards based on your score tier at the end of this collab-only Dojo challenge!<br>
Check the possible roads by tapping the Rewards List button at the top right of the Dojo menu.<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Fight off Healer and his Merc Storia allies as fast as you can to earn a place in the top 1% of the Dojo Rankings!'''}}<br>
<small><small>※Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!<br>
※Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen.<br>
※Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※Exiting the Battle screen during an Arena challenge will not restore spent Cat Food.<br>
※Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor. Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a play ban.<br>
※Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※If the Arena of Honor does not become available during this event, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Special Gamatoto expedition areas!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Events'''}}<br>
Call on the friendly monster ally Toto to help Gamatoto on his adventures and unearth even more prizes! Plus, only during this Merc Storia collab event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited area {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Mystery Spring'''}} for a ton of extra XP!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Area'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited area {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Login Stamp Rewards each day!'''}}<br>
Every day you cisit the Cat Base menu during this campaign you will pick up another login stamp! More login stamps will get you bigger and better prizes, including {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Special collab unit "'''}}[[Titi (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Titi'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00FF|'''" on Day 1'''}} and {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Special collab Unit "'''}}[[Merc (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Merc'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00FF|'''" on Day 7'''}}.<br>
Play the Battle Cats every day and don't miss a single prize!
